 "text": "Get Started\nEN\nABOUT\nCONTACT US\nAbout Reprise AI\n\nReprise AI is a Tampa, Florida-based AI consulting and implementation agency, founded in 2023.\n\nWe're industry agnostic. We design, build, and deploy custom AI Operating Systems for any business with proven operational logic — voice agents, chat agents, RAG pipelines, workflow automation, and CRM/phone/scheduling integrations.\n\nWe've completed approximately 100 AI implementation projects over 36 months of delivering agentic AI in production, with an average $600K ROI in the first year.\n\nClients own 100% of the code, infrastructure, and integrations we build. No vendor lock-in. No platform fees. No hostage data.\n\nWe serve clients across the Tampa Bay region and nationwide.\n\nMeet Our Team\n\nOur founders bring together decades of experience in AI, business strategy, and technology implementation.\n\nNick Puru\n\nCo-Founder & CEO\n\nNick leads our strategic vision and client relationships. With a background in business development and AI implementation, he ensures every solution delivers real business value.\n\nKeshav Sukirya\n\nCo-Founder & CTO\n\nKeshav oversees our technical development and AI architecture. His expertise in machine learning and system design ensures our solutions are both cutting-edge and reliable.\n\nTrusted by Industry Leaders\n\nWe've had the privilege of working with amazing companies across various industries.\n\nCyft AI\nRISK ACADEMY\nSierra Productions\nDropouts Media\nPilotbird\nHeirship\nBanaland Company\nCloud 9 Internet\nReady to Get Started?\n\nLet's discuss how AI can transform your business. Book a discovery call to explore the possibilities.\n\nBook a Discovery Call\n\nReprise AI·Tampa, FL·(813) 285-0190·hello@repriseai.com\n\nAI consulting and implementation agency serving Tampa Bay and clients nationwide.\n\nAI consulting and implementation partner. We design, build, and deploy the AI Operating System that runs your business.\n\n© 2026 Reprise AI. All rights reserved.\n\nServices\nAI Transformation\nAI Implementation\nAI Education\nAI Consulting Services\nAI Operating System\nCompany\nAbout Us\nCase Studies\nCompare Approaches\nFAQ\nBest AI Agencies 2026\nAI Tutorials\nLearning Library\nNewsletter\nLegal\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms of Service\nContact\nContact Us\nhello@repriseai.com\n\nAI Consulting & Implementation Agency · Tampa, FL",
